  "description": "Join the all-night investigation at an abandoned building where reports of paranormal activity have never stopped. As a member of a ghost-hunting team, explore empty rooms and dark corridors while monitoring supernatural phenomena.\nUse professional detection equipment to track strange fluctuations, record unexplained sounds, and document sightings. As the night progresses, activity intensifies and the building’s hidden past begins to surface.\n\nKey Features:\n\t•\tExplore a large abandoned location filled with dark rooms and hidden areas\n\t•\tUse ghost-hunting gadgets to detect and record paranormal activity\n\t•\tInvestigate dynamic supernatural events that escalate throughout the night\n\t•\tFind clues and environmental details that reveal the building’s history\n\t•\tSolve puzzles and uncover the mystery behind the haunting\n\t•\tImmersive atmosphere focused on tension and suspense\n\n\nThe night is long, and the building is never truly silent. Every sound could be a sign, every shadow a warning. Stay focused, trust your equipment, and uncover the truth before it’s too late.\nWill you leave with evidence… or become part of the legend?",
